messages[10]{user,text}:
  user_1,[00:00] Hi Karan, it's Kriti. I got the payment link you sent, but I'm not sure how to proceed.
  user_2,[00:05] Hey Kriti, sure—just click the link, it takes you to our secure portal.
  user_1,[00:12] Umm, I see the amount $345. Is that the total? No extra fees?
  user_2,[00:18] Yes, that's the full premium for the 3‑month term. No hidden charges.
  user_1,[00:25] [sighs] Great. Also, can you confirm the collision and comprehensive limits again? I want to be 100% sure before I pay.
  user_2,[00:30] Absolutely—collision is $25,000, comprehensive $20,000, same as we discussed.
  user_1,[00:38] Got it. One more thing—once I pay, when does the coverage start? Immediately?
  user_2,[00:45] As soon as the payment processes, usually within a few minutes. We'll send you a confirmation email.
  user_1,[00:52] Perfect. I'll go ahead now. If anything pops up, can I call you back?
  user_2,[00:58] Sure thing, just give me a call or reply here. Have a good day!